<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PLANEJAMENTO QUE GERA RESULTADO</span><h1>Sua agenda<span class="orange">.</span></h1><p>Todos os atendimentos, no ritmo dos seus alunos.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="<?= url('appointment-form') ?>"><?= icon('plus') ?> Novo agendamento</a></div>
<section class="panel appointments-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Agendamentos <span class="count"><?= count($appointments) ?></span></h2><p>Organize os próximos passos de cada aluno.</p></div></div><form class="filters" method="get" action="/index.php"><input type="hidden" name="route" value="appointments"><div class="search-field"><?= icon('search') ?><label for="q" class="sr-only">Buscar aluno ou modalidade</label><input id="q" name="q" placeholder="Buscar aluno ou modalidade..." value="<?= e($search) ?>" maxlength="100"></div><label class="sr-only" for="status-filter">Filtrar situação</label><select id="status-filter" name="status"><option value="">Todas as situações</option><?php foreach (\App\Models\Appointment::STATUSES as $s): ?><option <?= $status===$s?'selected':'' ?>><?= e($s) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select><button class="button secondary" type="submit">Filtrar</button><?php if ($search || $status): ?><a class="text-link" href="<?= url('appointments') ?>">Limpar</a><?php endif; ?></form>
